428 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1094 0 R
/E (Next, we use Bresenham's Line Algorithm. This is the same algorithm implemented on the microcontroller, which intelligently decides which motor to pulse at each moment to create the straightest possible line.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
429 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1095 0 R
