<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1178 0 R
/E (Could not make it fully functional ready to use, instead, we just provided proof of concept. Reasons: Due to budgetary and time constraints. We wanted to use 64 hall sensors and each hall sensor costs 30INR, but since we had to restrict ourselves under 5000 INR, we bought just few to test our concept.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1179 0 R
/E (Most of the parts used in our project were 3D-printed, which turned out to faulty many a times when we used micro-factory facilities, this wasted a lot of out time in just removing supports or filing the parts.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
522 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
